PH000Open the issueKTPH001 at KTPH002https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/newKTPH003: use a short, specific title (e.g. KTPH004\"SFTP tab freezes when renaming a file on Windows 11\"KTPH005), paste the collected facts into the description, and submit it.","f":["<strong>","</strong>","<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/new\">","</a>","<em>","</em>"]},{"s":34720,"e":34834,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Stay reachableKTPH001 — follow-up questions on the issue are common; enable GitHub notifications for it.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":34907,"e":34920,"k":"block","t":"Data Security","f":[]},{"s":34928,"e":35114,"k":"block","t":"Log files and screenshots can contain sensitive information such as hostnames, usernames, file paths or session details. Review and redact everything you attach to a public GitHub issue.","f":[]},{"s":35161,"e":35275,"k":"block","t":"Suggest a feature or ideaKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#suggest-a-feature-or-idea\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":35290,"e":35498,"k":"block","t":"Check KTPH000https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issuesKTPH001 for similar suggestions first — add a comment or a 👍 reaction there instead of opening a duplicate.","f":["<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues\">","</a>"]},{"s":35508,"e":35757,"k":"block","t":"Open a new issue at KTPH001https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/newKTPH002 with a title starting with KTPH000 (e.g. KTPH003\"Feature: bookmark folders in the connection manager\"KTPH004).","f":["<code>Feature:</code>","<a href=\"https://github.com/chardonnay/korTTY/issues/new\">","</a>","<em>","</em>"]},{"s":35767,"e":35982,"k":"block","t":"Describe the KTPH000use caseKTPH001 — what you are trying to accomplish and why the current behavior falls short — rather than only the solution you have in mind. Mockups or examples from other tools are welcome.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":35997,"e":36095,"k":"block","t":"Release notes for shipp